From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] allwinner: start the Brick A133 vendor SCP transport

Implement the exact bounded vendor mailbox startup and nonce loopback,
validate SCP-owned queue routing, and reserve the stock standby scratch.
The opt-in profile exposes no PSCI system-suspend operation.

Signed-off-by: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
---
